{"id":"clown","lemma":"clown","pos":"noun","rank":2425,"glosses":["clown (performer)","clown (person who acts in a comic way)"],"ipa":"/klun/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/Fr-clown.ogg/Fr-clown.ogg.mp3","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"clowns","feminine":"clownesse"},"formAudio":{"clowns":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-clowns.wav","clownesse":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-clownesse.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le clown faisait un drôle de visage.","en":"The clown made a funny face.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"face"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"funny"]]},{"text":"Arrêtez de faire les clowns !","en":"Stop clowning around.","words":[{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Ne dis pas à ton père que tu veux devenir clown.","en":"Don't tell your father you want to become a clown.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to become"},null]},{"text":"Le clown a fait exprès de tomber.","en":"The clown fell down on purpose.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"express"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to fall"}]},{"text":"Il s'habille comme un gentleman mais il parle et agit comme un clown.","en":"His dress is that of a gentleman, but his speech and behavior are those of a clown.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to dress","l":"habiller"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"gentleman"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to act, to do","l":"agir"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}